 XSTR("[[Duration: ~28 min | Difficulty: Hard]] The tanker Cassia needs half an hour at the Halyard's picket station to top up the fleet's reserves, and the Cylons will find out. Red flight holds the station through six waves until Cassia's pumps are done and both ships can jump.", -1)
$end_multi_text

